ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:


  In spring, Mbaba's attempted cast of the Tornado spell didn't work.  A 
mysterious magical counterspell seemed to have impeded her spell.

  In Limerick, Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) brought to bay 
Lady of Beer Mbaba.  Teleko (#72) commanded the attacking armies.  The 
defenders were commanded by Mbaba.  The armies were drawn up into lines of 
battle as shown here:

